#, no-wrap
msgid "How to install and use transpiler plugins in Qiskit."
msgstr "Comment installer et utiliser des plugins de transpilation dans Qiskit."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install and use transpiler plugins"
msgstr "Installer et utiliser des plugins de transpilation"

