#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Le code de cette page a été développé avec les dépendances suivantes.\n"
"Nous recommandons d'utiliser ces versions ou des versions plus récentes.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To facilitate the development and reuse of custom transpilation code by the wider community of Qiskit users, the Qiskit SDK supports a plugin interface that enables third-party Python packages to declare that they provide extended transpilation functionality accessible via Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Pour faciliter le développement et la réutilisation de code de transpilation personnalisé par la communauté Qiskit, le SDK Qiskit propose une interface de plugins qui permet à des paquets Python tiers de déclarer qu'ils fournissent des fonctionnalités de transpilation étendues accessibles via Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently, third-party plugins can provide extended transpilation functionality in three ways:\n"
msgstr "Actuellement, les plugins tiers peuvent enrichir la transpilation de trois façons :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [transpiler stage plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) provides a pass manager that can be used in place of one of the [6 stages](transpiler-stages) of a preset staged pass manager: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, and `scheduling`.\n"
msgstr "Un [plugin de phase de transpilation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) fournit un gestionnaire de passes pouvant remplacer l'une des [6 phases](transpiler-stages) d'un gestionnaire de passes par phases prédéfini : `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization` et `scheduling`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [unitary synthesis plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin) provides extended functionality for unitary gate synthesis.\n"
msgstr "Un [plugin de synthèse unitaire](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin) offre des fonctionnalités étendues pour la synthèse de portes unitaires.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [high-level synthesis plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin) provides extended functionality for synthesizing \"high-level objects\" such as linear functions or Clifford operators. High-level objects are represented by subclasses of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class.\n"
msgstr "Un [plugin de synthèse de haut niveau](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin) offre des fonctionnalités étendues pour la synthèse d'« objets de haut niveau » tels que les fonctions linéaires ou les opérateurs de Clifford. Ces objets de haut niveau sont représentés par des sous-classes de la classe [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rest of the page describes how to list available plugins, install new ones, and use them.\n"
msgstr "Le reste de cette page explique comment lister les plugins disponibles, en installer de nouveaux et les utiliser.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available plugins and install new ones {#list-available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"
msgstr "Lister les plugins disponibles et en installer de nouveaux {#list-available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit already includes some built-in plugins for transpilation. To install more, you can use your Python package manager. For example, you might run `pip install qiskit-toqm` to install the [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) routing stage plugin. A number of third-party plugins are part of the [Qiskit ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"
msgstr "Qiskit intègre déjà quelques plugins de transpilation. Pour en installer d'autres, tu peux utiliser ton gestionnaire de paquets Python. Par exemple, tu peux exécuter `pip install qiskit-toqm` pour installer le plugin de phase de routage [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm). Plusieurs plugins tiers font partie de l'[écosystème Qiskit](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available transpiler stage plugins {#list-available-transpiler-stage-plugins}"
msgstr "Lister les plugins de phase de transpilation disponibles {#list-available-transpiler-stage-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins) function, passing the name of the stage whose plugins you want to list.\n"
msgstr "Utilise la fonction [list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins) en lui passant le nom de la phase dont tu veux lister les plugins.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid " If `qiskit-toqm` were installed, then `toqm` would appear in the list of `routing` plugins.\n"
msgstr "Si `qiskit-toqm` était installé, `toqm` apparaîtrait dans la liste des plugins de `routing`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available unitary synthesis plugins {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Lister les plugins de synthèse unitaire disponibles {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names) function.\n"
msgstr "Utilise la fonction [unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available high-level synthesis plugins {#list-available-high-level-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Lister les plugins de synthèse de haut niveau disponibles {#list-available-high-level-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names) function, passing the name of the type of \"high-level object\" to be synthesized. The name corresponds to the [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
msgstr "Utilise la fonction [high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names) en lui passant le nom du type d'« objet de haut niveau » à synthétiser. Ce nom correspond à l'attribut [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) de la classe [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) représentant le type d'objet à synthétiser.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the [HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager) class to list the names of all high-level synthesis plugins:\n"
msgstr "Tu peux utiliser la classe [HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager) pour lister les noms de tous les plugins de synthèse de haut niveau :\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a plugin {#use-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Utiliser un plugin {#use-a-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this section, we show how to use transpiler plugins. In the code examples, we use plugins that come with Qiskit, but plugins installed from third-party packages are used the same way.\n"
msgstr "Dans cette section, nous montrons comment utiliser des plugins de transpilation. Les exemples de code utilisent des plugins fournis avec Qiskit, mais les plugins installés depuis des paquets tiers s'utilisent de la même façon.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"
msgstr "Utiliser un plugin de phase de transpilation {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a transpiler stage plugin, specify its name with the appropriate argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). The argument is formed by appending `_method` to the name of the transpilation stage. For example, to use the `lookahead` routing plugin, we would specify `lookahead` for the `routing_method` argument.\n"
msgstr "Pour utiliser un plugin de phase de transpilation, indique son nom dans l'argument approprié de [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) ou de [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Cet argument se forme en ajoutant `_method` au nom de la phase de transpilation. Par exemple, pour utiliser le plugin de routage `lookahead`, on passe `lookahead` à l'argument `routing_method`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Le backend simulé `FakeSherbrooke` de `qiskit_ibm_runtime` est utilisé dans ces exemples, mais tu peux l'essayer sur n'importe quel backend réel ou simulé compatible avec Qiskit. Tes résultats pourraient être différents.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Utiliser un plugin de synthèse unitaire {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a unitary synthesis plugin, specify its name as the `unitary_synthesis_method` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr "Pour utiliser un plugin de synthèse unitaire, indique son nom dans l'argument `unitary_synthesis_method` de [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) ou de [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile) :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unitary synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or used in [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these stages.\n"
msgstr "La synthèse unitaire est utilisée dans les phases `init`, `translation` et `optimization` du gestionnaire de passes par phases retourné par [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) ou utilisé dans [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Consulte [Étapes du transpileur](transpiler-stages) pour une description de ces étapes.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config` argument, a free-form dictionary, to pass options for the unitary synthesis method. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in unitary synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr "Utilise l'argument `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config`, un dictionnaire de forme libre, pour transmettre des options à la méthode de synthèse unitaire. La documentation de la méthode de synthèse doit expliquer les options qu'elle prend en charge. Consulte [cette liste](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-synthesis-plugins-2) pour accéder à la documentation des plugins de synthèse unitaire intégrés.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Utiliser un plugin de synthèse de haut niveau {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create an [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) to\n"
"store the names of the plugins to use for various high-level objects. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Commence par créer un objet [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) pour\n"
"stocker les noms des plugins à utiliser pour différents objets de haut niveau. Par exemple :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This code cell creates a high-level synthesis configuration that uses the `layers` plugin\n"
"for synthesizing [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) objects and the `pmh` plugin for synthesizing\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction) objects. The names of the keyword arguments correspond to the\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
"For each high-level object, the list of given plugins are tried in sequence until one of them\n"
"succeeds (in the example above, each list only contains a single plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ce bloc de code crée une configuration de synthèse de haut niveau qui utilise le plugin `layers`\n"
"pour synthétiser des objets [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) et le plugin `pmh` pour synthétiser des objets\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction). Les noms des arguments nommés correspondent à l'attribut\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) de la classe [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) représentant le type d'objet à synthétiser.\n"
"Pour chaque objet de haut niveau, les plugins de la liste sont essayés dans l'ordre jusqu'à ce que l'un d'eux réussisse (dans l'exemple ci-dessus, chaque liste ne contient qu'un seul plugin).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to specifying\n"
"a plugin by its name, you can instead pass a `(name, options)` tuple, where the second element of the tuple is a dictionary containing options for the plugin. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in high-level synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr "En plus de spécifier un plugin par son nom, tu peux également passer un tuple `(name, options)`, dont le second élément est un dictionnaire contenant les options du plugin. La documentation de la méthode de synthèse doit expliquer les options qu'elle prend en charge. Consulte [cette liste](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) pour accéder à la documentation des plugins de synthèse de haut niveau intégrés.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have created the `HLSConfig` object, pass it as the\n"
"`hls_config` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Une fois l'objet `HLSConfig` créé, passe-le via l'argument\n"
"`hls_config` à [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) ou à [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile) :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "High-level synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or used in [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these stages.\n"
msgstr "La synthèse de haut niveau est utilisée dans les phases `init`, `translation` et `optimization` du gestionnaire de passes par phases retourné par [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) ou utilisé dans [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Consulte [Étapes du transpileur](transpiler-stages) pour une description de ces étapes.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Prochaines étapes {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendation\">\n"
"- [Create a transpiler plugin](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Check out the [tutorials](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) for examples of transpiling and running quantum circuits.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommandation\">\n"
"- [Créer un plugin de transpilation](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"- Consulte les [tutoriels](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) pour des exemples de transpilation et d'exécution de circuits quantiques.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
